  "_dynamic_allocations": "VLA/alloca bytes per function. Preferences::getString: a char[len+1] for the stored NVS string (our values are names/credentials, <= 64 B). ppTxFragmentProc (libpp): a buffer of roundup2(fragment) bytes, the fragment bounded by the 2346 B fragmentation threshold. s_i2c_start_end_command (IDF i2c_master): two VLAs of roundup16(0 or 1) bytes = 32 B max (disassembly: andi -16 of s2+15, s2 in {0,1}).",
